  "id": "bang-bang-cauliflower-tacos",
  "name": "Bang Bang Cauliflower Tacos",
  "subtitle": "Crisp baked cauliflower with spicy-sweet sauce and fresh toppings",
  "description": "Coat cauliflower in a smoked paprika batter and panko, bake until crisp, then toss with a sweet-spicy sauce and serve in warm tortillas with fresh toppings.",
